        {
          "question": "What is the minimum order quantity?",
          "answer": "The listing MOQ is 5 pairs. Please confirm the requested color and size mix and availability for the order."
        },
        {
          "question": "How is the quantity price arranged?",
          "answer": "The listed FOB price tiers are USD 8.50 per pair for 5-49 pairs, USD 8.30 per pair for 50-99 pairs, and USD 8.00 per pair for 100+ pairs. Share the quantity, color-size mix and packing needs for a current quotation."
